<title>Yoga by the sea</title>
<link>http://www.saltwateryoga.test/home</link>
<pubDate>Mon, 01 Feb 2021 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<dc:creator>nina@saltwateryoga.test</dc:creator>
<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img src="http://images.squarespace-cdn.test/content/v1/5f2a9c1e8d3b4a0012c7e6f1/1612183201345-K2PQ8XG7/studio-window.jpg" alt="" /></p>
<p>Saltwater Yoga is a small studio above Fistral Beach in Newquay, with classes for every body and every level.</p>
<p>Come as you are. Mats, blocks and blankets are all provided.</p>]]></content:encoded>
