<item>
<title>About Saltwater</title>
<link>http://www.saltwateryoga.test/about</link>
<pubDate>Mon, 01 Feb 2021 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<dc:creator>nina@saltwateryoga.test</dc:creator>
<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img src="http://images.squarespace-cdn.test/content/v1/5f2a9c1e8d3b4a0012c7e6f1/1612183299812-ZQ4L2M9B/nina.jpg" alt="" /></p>
<p>Saltwater Yoga was opened in 2021 by Nina Polglase, after fifteen years of teaching yoga in Bristol and Bali.</p>
<p>Nina is a Yoga Alliance registered teacher (E-RYT 500) and also teaches pregnancy and postnatal yoga.</p>]]></content:encoded>
