<item>
<title>Timetable</title>
<link>http://www.saltwateryoga.test/timetable</link>
<pubDate>Mon, 01 Feb 2021 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<dc:creator>nina@saltwateryoga.test</dc:creator>
<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Monday 7am: Sunrise flow. Monday 6.30pm: Yin and restore.</p>
