<item>
<title>What is yin yoga?</title>
<link>http://www.saltwateryoga.test/blog/what-is-yin-yoga</link>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Sep 2024 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
<dc:creator>nina@saltwateryoga.test</dc:creator>
<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Yin is a slow, quiet practice where poses are held for three to five minutes, working into the deeper tissues of the body.</p>
<p>It is the perfect balance to a busy week, and to surfing.</p>]]></content:encoded>
